# CCL CAHCET Central Library — Architecture & Tech Stack

## Project Overview

**CAHCET Central Library** (`ccl_lib_cahcet`) is a college library website for the **C. Abdul Hakeem College of Engineering & Technology**. It provides public-facing pages (about, gallery, journals, e-resources, OPAC, etc.) and an **admin panel** for managing site content.

