## Frontend

### Framework & Rendering
- **Next.js 15 App Router** — uses the `app/` directory convention for file-system based routing with React Server Components (RSC) enabled (`"rsc": true` in `components.json`).
- **TypeScript** throughout — strict mode, bundler module resolution, path aliases (`@/*`).

### Styling
- **Tailwind CSS v3** with `tailwindcss-animate` plugin.
- **CSS custom properties (HSL)** for theming — defined in `app/globals.css`, consumed via Tailwind config.
- Custom color palettes: teal, emerald, violet, amber.
- Custom keyframes/animations: marquee, fadeIn, slideUp, pulse, accordion.
- Dark mode support scaffolded (`darkMode: ["class"]`) but currently **commented out** in the layout.

### Component System (shadcn/ui)
50 pre-built UI components in `components/ui/`, including:

| Category | Components |
|---|---|
| **Layout** | Card, Sidebar, Separator, Resizable Panels, Scroll Area, Sheet, Aspect Ratio |
| **Navigation** | Navigation Menu, Menubar, Breadcrumb, Tabs, Pagination |
| **Forms** | Input, Textarea, Select, Checkbox, Radio Group, Switch, Slider, Calendar, Date Picker (via react-day-picker), Input OTP, Form (with react-hook-form integration) |
| **Feedback** | Toast/Toaster (Radix + Sonner), Alert, Alert Dialog, Dialog, Drawer (vaul), Progress, Skeleton |
| **Data Display** | Table, Badge, Avatar, Hover Card, Tooltip, Carousel (embla-carousel), Chart (recharts) |
| **Overlays** | Popover, Dropdown Menu, Context Menu, Command (cmdk), Collapsible, Accordion |
| **Misc** | Button, Toggle, Toggle Group, Label |

