## Backend

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This project has **no traditional backend server or API layer**. All data is served statically or managed client-side.

### Data Architecture
- **Static data files** in `data/` directory serve as the primary data source:
  - [library-data.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/ccl/ccl_cahcet/data/library-data.tsx) — Master data file containing site info, navigation, statistics, announcements, hours, committee, about, rules, e-resources, gallery, and policy data
  - [journals-data.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/ccl/ccl_cahcet/data/journals-data.tsx) — Journals catalog data
  - [syllabi-data.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/ccl/ccl_cahcet/data/syllabi-data.tsx) — Syllabi/curriculum data

- **Data Service Layer** (`lib/data-service.ts`) — Provides getter functions that:
  1. Check `localStorage` for admin-modified values
  2. Fall back to static defaults from `library-data.tsx`
  3. Merge overrides with defaults using spread operators

### Admin Content Management
The admin panel (`app/admin/`) allows editing content which gets persisted to **browser `localStorage`** — there is no server-side database. Admin sections include:

| Admin Page | Route | Manages |
|---|---|---|
| Dashboard | `/admin` | Overview statistics |
| About | `/admin/about` | Library about page content |
| Announcements | `/admin/announcements` | News & announcements |
| Committee | `/admin/committee` | Committee member info |
| Contact | `/admin/contact` | Contact page details |
| E-Resources | `/admin/e-resources` | Electronic resource links |
| Gallery | `/admin/gallery` | Photo gallery management |
| Hours | `/admin/hours` | Library operating hours |
| Journals | `/admin/journals` | Journal catalog |
| Login | `/admin/login` | Admin authentication |
| Policy | `/admin/policy` | Library policies |
| Rules | `/admin/rules` | Rules & regulations |
| Site Settings | `/admin/site-settings` | Global site configuration |
| Statistics | `/admin/statistics` | Library stats |
| Syllabi | `/admin/syllabi` | Course syllabi |

