## Database / Storage

> [!NOTE]
> There is **no external database** (no SQL, no Supabase, no Firebase currently integrated in the codebase).

| Storage Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Static Data** | TypeScript files (`data/*.tsx`) | Default/seed content |
| **Client-Side Persistence** | Browser `localStorage` | Admin-edited content overrides |
| **Static Assets** | `public/` directory | Images (JPG/PNG), favicons, placeholders |

### Static Assets in `public/`
- Library photos: entrance, bookshelf, digital library, OPAC, issue counter
- Logos: `logo-ccl.png`
- Placeholders: SVG and JPG placeholder images
- Favicons

